WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:05.300
Meiosis gives each gamete one chromosome from each pair, chosen at random.

2
00:00:06.026 --> 00:00:10.251
Three pairs of chromosomes: one of each pair came from each parent.

3
00:00:12.158 --> 00:00:15.808
A gamete gets one from each pair, chosen at random.

4
00:00:18.907 --> 00:00:23.457
Each gamete is a different mix: over eight million possible in humans.
